docs/octopus-os/07-INCIDENTS.md:760:- **P1 complementary (not a duplicate of #148/#116/#158):** `admit_slot` classifies occupy/release/inspect/steal. occupy is a START (HALT refuses). release/inspect continue. steal never admitted. `pin_occupy` classifies pin/unpin/inspect. pin is a START. Occupying or pinning an occupy is not persist, not write, not send. Timeout is UNKNOWN, not a concurrent-write proof. `campaign_envelope_ready` structurally ≠ `send_authorized`. `grants_send` / `halt_blocks_release` / `halt_blocks_unpin` / `occupy_is_persist` / `occupy_is_write` / `occupy_is_send` / `steals_slot` / `ready_is_authorized` / `claims_immutable` / `unknown_is_false` / `timeout_proves_concurrent` / `proposal_is_execution` / `promotes_ready_to_send` / `wires_into_run_store` structurally False. Not wired into `run_store.py`. HEAD `19267278dd7630d32b6f9a099c4e3c35f311c7e6` (pushed; `origin/feat/p1-slot-occupy-20260903` MATCH `2026-09-03T13:52:21Z`). Ready ≠ authorized.
docs/octopus-os/07-INCIDENTS.md:780:- **P1 complementary (not a duplicate of #82/#87/#127/#136/#143/#145/#148 or concurrent slot-occupy):** `admit_epoch` admits `open` only. `cut` / `rewrite` / `truncate` are known refusals. Unknown state is UNKNOWN, not open. A `run_id` is not an epoch. `pin_cut` admits a cut only from an `open` prior. Missing prior is UNKNOWN, not open. Second cut → `already_cut` (not rewrite). Cut is not truncate. Sealed send/ready names refuse (`sealed_effect`). `campaign_envelope_ready` structurally ≠ `send_authorized`. `grants_send` / `halt_blocks_*` / `ready_is_authorized` / `claims_immutable` / `unknown_is_false` / `unknown_state_is_open` / `unknown_prior_is_open` / `cut_is_truncate` / `cut_is_rewrite` / `proposal_is_execution` / `wires_into_run_store` structurally False. `later_disarm_supersedes` structurally True. HALT stops STARTS, not window classify or in-flight cut. Not wired into `run_store.py`. Engineering HEAD `c2086fc186551b02888673d93bc2877c11c67c07`. PR https://github.com/ari-OCTOPUS/ofn-node/pull/167. Branch `feat/p1-epoch-cut-20260903`. Parent `1b46f772d19942a3c5c03f2ccebdc9a81bff8d80` (`#163`). Ready ≠ authorized.
